cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Drone Building Scans — Two Roof Types"
abstract: >-
  Two complete drone photogrammetry image sets of commercial buildings in the Minneapolis
  suburbs, captured August 2026 with a DJI FC9313 at native 4096x3072 resolution. A flat
  membrane roof with rooftop HVAC (951 images, 951 aligned) and a pitched asphalt shingle roof
  (395 images, 384 aligned). Both flown below 16 m with gimbal angles spanning nadir to level,
  covering roof, roof edge and walls. GPS intact on every frame, original aircraft filenames
  preserved. Solved camera poses in COLMAP format, sparse tie point clouds, and textured
  reference models are included. The flat-roof scan is metrically scaled from a 1.997 m
  AprilTag calibration bar used as control points.
authors:
